{
  "name": "Auto-Reply for Out of Office",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "filters": {
          "labelIds": ["INBOX"]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [250, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "filters": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Read Client List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [500, 300],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "If Sender Is Client",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [750, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from }}",
        "subject": "Re: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.subject }}",
        "message": "Hi,\n\nThank you for your email. I am currently out of the office and will have limited access to email.\n\nI will be returning on [RETURN_DATE]. During my absence, please contact [BACKUP_CONTACT] at [BACKUP_EMAIL] for urgent matters.\n\nI will respond to your email upon my return.\n\nBest regards",
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Gmail Auto-Reply OOO",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1000, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": ""
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "values": {
            "values": [
              { "column": "sender", "value": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from }}" },
              { "column": "subject", "value": "={{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.subject }}" },
              { "column": "autoRepliedAt", "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}" },
              { "column": "isClient", "value": "true" }
            ]
          }
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "name": "Log to Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [1250, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": ""
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Auto-Reply for Out of Office\n\nAutomatically replies to client emails with an OOO message.\n\n**Flow:**\n1. Gmail trigger on new inbox email\n2. Read client list from Google Sheets\n3. If sender matches a client → send OOO reply\n4. Log auto-reply to Sheets\n\n**Setup:**\n- Connect Gmail OAuth2 credentials\n- Connect Google Sheets credentials\n- Client list sheet needs 'email' column\n- Customize the OOO message with return date and backup contact",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 300
      },
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [250, -50]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Gmail Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Read Client List",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Read Client List": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "If Sender Is Client",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "If Sender Is Client": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Gmail Auto-Reply OOO",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gmail Auto-Reply OOO": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Log to Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  }
}